      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** Superb 3-Bed End-of-Terrace Home with Development Potential – Moeran Road, Walkinstown, Dublin 12 *** \r\n\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are proud to present new to the market for sale No: 10 Moeran Road, Located on the much sought-after Moeran Road, this beautifully presented three-bedroom end-of-terrace home enjoys a peaceful setting on a quiet, mature road with an abundance of parks, schools, shops, and local services right on its doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe property sits on a large, corner site, offering excellent potential to extend the existing home or build a second dwelling (subject to planning permission).\r\n\r\n\r\nRenovated in 2013, the house benefits from external insulation, providing superb warmth and energy efficiency throughout. Its south-west facing orientation is second to none, ensuring the private, not-overlooked rear garden enjoys sunshine from morning until evening.\r\nThe garden has been beautifully landscaped, featuring Indian sandstone paving and a low-maintenance layout — the perfect outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\r\nThe ground floor features a bathroom complete with a walk-in Mira shower. To the front, there is a sitting room. To the rear, you’ll find an open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, highlighted by a beautiful solid-fuel Stanley stove. French doors open out to a private garden, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom, offering comfortable and practical living space for any household.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe attic is fully floored, providing valuable additional storage space.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo the front, there is a large garden with a driveway providing off street parking \r\n\r\n\r\nThe property is well serviced by a host of bus routes such as the 17, 18, 27, 56a 83, 150, and 151 all on its doorstep as well as a number of excellent schools. The M-50 is also only a short distance away and provides easy access to most major route-ways as well as an express route to Dublin Airport. The Luas Red line is located within walking distance."
      },
